docs/APPLICATIONS.md:491:- `document_optimization`: present only when optimization is enabled. The current payload includes `status`, `method`, `optimizer_backend`, `initial_score`, `final_score`, `iteration_count`, `accepted_iterations`, `optimized_sections`, `artifact_cid`, `trace_storage`, `trace_download_url`, `trace_view_url`, `router_status`, `router_usage`, `upstream_optimizer`, `intake_status`, `intake_constraints`, `packet_projection`, and `section_history`.
