docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:256:- `decision_source`: Claim-support validation now distinguishes temporal-rule failures from generic support gaps via `temporal_rule_partial` and `temporal_rule_failed`.
docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:260:When a temporal rule profile is available, element reasoning diagnostics may also expose a `temporal_proof_bundle` that packages the chronology, legal frame, and theorem exports into one durable review and proof artifact.
